This is a changed Gallina reimplementation: structural syntax, list-backed
guarded universe sublevels, de Bruijn local contexts, fuel-explicit pure
checking, no pointer caches or native substitutions, explicit declines.
The upstream verification assumptions and unfinished proofs are not imported.

The universe algorithm follows Yoan Geran, "A Canonical Form for Universe
Levels in Impredicative Type Theory", as implemented and attributed in
Lean4Lean/Level.lean. No claim of complete formal verification is made.
